    "bubble_choice_description": "Add a count message, a filter summary label, and a friendly empty state to a restaurant search app.",
    "long_instructions": "## Restaurant Finder\r\n\r\n**Goal:**  \r\nAdd transparency cues so users know which restaurants are shown, which filters are active, and what happens when nothing matches.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n1. **Open `script.js`.**  \r\n   Find the `render()` function. This is where the restaurant list is built.\r\n\r\n2. **Add three messages:**\r\n\r\n   * **Count message:**  \r\n     Update `#countMessage` to show how many restaurants are displayed.  \r\n     Example: `Showing 4 of 12 results`\r\n\r\n   * **Filter label:**  \r\n     Update `#filterLabel` to describe the active filters.  \r\n     Example: `Filters: any cuisine, $$$ or less, open now`\r\n\r\n   * **Empty-state message:**  \r\n     If no restaurants match, update `#emptyMessage` with a friendly message.  \r\n     Otherwise, clear the message.\r\n\r\n3. **Test your work.**\r\n\r\n4. **Use AI to check your reasoning.**",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>BiteCheck — Restaurant Finder</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <main class=\"app\">\n    <header class=\"top-bar\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"brand\">BiteCheck</p>\n        <h1>Find food nearby</h1>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"profile-button\" type=\"button\">BC</button>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"hero-card\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Open now near you</p>\n      <h2>Pick a spot without scrolling forever.</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"search-row\">\n        <span>📍 CodeTown</span>\n        <span>Tonight</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"filter-panel\" aria-label=\"Current restaurant filters\">\n      <p id=\"filterLabel\"></p>\n      <p id=\"countMessage\"></p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-label=\"Restaurant results\">\n      <ul id=\"restaurantList\"></ul>\n      <p id=\"emptyMessage\"></p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script src=\"data.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"helpers.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0",
          "type": "support"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  background: #111113;\n  color: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.app {\n  max-width: 430px;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  background: #18181b;\n  padding: 18px;\n}\n\n.top-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n}\n\n.brand {\n  color: #ff6b35;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  margin: 0 0 4px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 25px;\n  margin: 0;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.profile-button {\n  width: 42px;\n  height: 42px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  border: none;\n  background: #2a2a30;\n  color: #fff;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n.hero-card {\n  background:\n    linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.28), rgba(255, 214, 102, 0.14)),\n    #24242b;\n  border: 1px solid #383842;\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.eyebrow {\n  color: #ffd166;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.hero-card h2 {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 0 0 18px;\n}\n\n.search-row {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.search-row span {\n  background: #111113;\n  border: 1px solid #3f3f46;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n.filter-panel {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 10px;\n  background: #24242b;\n  border: 1px solid #383842;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.filter-panel p {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n#filterLabel {\n  color: #ffd166;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n#countMessage {\n  color: #b8beca;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n#restaurantList {\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.restaurant-card,\n#restaurantList li {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  color: #111827;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\n.restaurant-card h2 {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  margin: 0 0 10px;\n}\n\n.restaurant-details {\n  color: #4b5563;\n  margin: 0 0 14px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.restaurant-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 8px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.chip {\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n  color: #334155;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  padding: 6px 9px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.chip.open {\n  background: #dcfce7;\n  color: #166534;\n}\n\n.chip.closed {\n  background: #fee2e2;\n  color: #991b1b;\n}\n\n.restaurant-card button {\n  width: 100%;\n  background: #ff6b35;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.restaurant-card button:hover {\n  background: #ff7f4f;\n}\n\n.restaurant-card button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #ffffff;\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n#emptyMessage {\n  color: #b8beca;\n  background: #24242b;\n  border: 1px dashed #52525b;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-style: italic;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false,
          "type": "support"
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "const render = () => {\n  \n  const list = document.getElementById(\"restaurantList\");\n  const countMsg = document.getElementById(\"countMessage\");\n  const filterLabel = document.getElementById(\"filterLabel\");\n  const emptyMsg = document.getElementById(\"emptyMessage\");\n\n  list.innerHTML = \"\";\n\n  // Current app filters\n  const cuisine = \"any\";\n  const maxPrice = 3; // $$$ or less\n  const openNow = true;\n\n  const results = [];\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < restaurants.length; i++) {\n    const r = restaurants[i];\n\n    let cuisineOk;\n    if (cuisine === \"any\") {\n      cuisineOk = true;\n    } else {\n      cuisineOk = r.cuisine === cuisine;\n    }\n\n    const priceOk = r.price <= maxPrice;\n\n    let openOk;\n    if (openNow === false) {\n      openOk = true;\n    } else {\n      openOk = r.open === true;\n    }\n\n    if (cuisineOk && priceOk && openOk) {\n      results.push(r);\n      list.appendChild(createListItem(r));\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Add transparency cues here\n\n\n\n};\n\nrender();",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "helpers.js",
          "contents": "const createListItem = (restaurant) => {\n  const li = document.createElement(\"li\");\n  li.className = \"restaurant-card\";\n\n  let priceSymbols = \"\";\n  for (let i = 0; i < restaurant.price; i++) {\n    priceSymbols = priceSymbols + \"$\";\n  }\n\n  let status = \"Closed\";\n  let statusClass = \"closed\";\n  if (restaurant.open === true) {\n    status = \"Open now\";\n    statusClass = \"open\";\n  }\n\n  const name = document.createElement(\"h2\");\n  name.textContent = restaurant.name;\n\n  const meta = document.createElement(\"div\");\n  meta.className = \"restaurant-meta\";\n\n  const cuisineChip = document.createElement(\"span\");\n  cuisineChip.className = \"chip\";\n  cuisineChip.textContent = restaurant.cuisine;\n\n  const priceChip = document.createElement(\"span\");\n  priceChip.className = \"chip\";\n  priceChip.textContent = priceSymbols;\n\n  const statusChip = document.createElement(\"span\");\n  statusChip.className = \"chip \" + statusClass;\n  statusChip.textContent = status;\n\n  const button = document.createElement(\"button\");\n  button.type = \"button\";\n  button.textContent = \"View menu\";\n\n  meta.appendChild(cuisineChip);\n  meta.appendChild(priceChip);\n  meta.appendChild(statusChip);\n\n  li.appendChild(name);\n  li.appendChild(meta);\n  li.appendChild(button);\n\n  return li;\n};",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true,
          "type": "support"
        },
        "5": {
          "id": "5",
          "name": "data.js",
          "contents": "const restaurants = [\n  { name: \"Luna Verde\", cuisine: \"Mexican\", price: 2, open: true },\n  { name: \"Brick & Basil\", cuisine: \"Italian\", price: 3, open: false },\n  { name: \"Chili & Lime\", cuisine: \"Thai\", price: 1, open: true },\n  { name: \"Docks Diner\", cuisine: \"American\", price: 2, open: true },\n  { name: \"Tivoli\", cuisine: \"Italian\", price: 4, open: true },\n  { name: \"Sunset Grill\", cuisine: \"American\", price: 3, open: false }\n];\n\n// const restaurants = []; // test with an empty list",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false,
          "type": "support"
        }
      },
